{start_of_verse: 4}
Let [C]all who name Christ's [F]holy [C]name; give [Dm]God all [G]praise & [**]glo[C]ry
Let [C]all who own his [F]power pro[C]claim [A]a[Dm]loud the [G]wondrous [**]sto[C]ry
Cast [Em]each false i[Am]dol [D]from its [G]throne
For [C]Christ is Lord & [D]Christ a[G]lone
